From: paulcor <paulcor@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 9 Feb 2025 21:26:47 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] Use GtkFileChooserNative for wxFileDialog/wxDirDialog
 when possible

This allows "native" dialogs with KDE. Not supported for extra control or wxFD_PREVIEW.
See #24486, #25104

(cherry picked from commit 071b4dd0f105e6d6ecd210190ce65bf41d6f1e2a)
---
